    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275088</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>っし。
じゃ、行こうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...A'ight. Then,
let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275148</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>待って</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275232</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……っとと。なんだよ、&lt;Mel&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Huh? What's up, &lt;Mel&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>本当に平気かな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is this really okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>精霊に会うとか、
その……２００年前の
世界とか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meeting the spirits...
And...travelling in time,
to 200 years ago...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275748</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……じゃあ、
この時代で魔術の暴走を
止める手段探す？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Then, should we just try to find
a way to bring the magic under
control here, in our own time?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275748</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>見つかるかどうかは
わからないけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We don't know if we'll be able
to find one or not, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと待てよ、
目の前にうまくいく方法が
あんだぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, hold it right there. We
already have a way to fix it,
right in front of us, don't we!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なのに、なんで
どうなるかわかんない
そっちの方法取んだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So why the hell would we
look for some other method
we don't even know will work?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ゴメン……
今のなしね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry... Please
just, forget I
said anything.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんなこと言ってる場合
じゃないんだもん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Since this really isn't
the time to fuss
over things like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276336</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……んじゃ、いんだな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Then, we're good?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん。
さ、行こ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah.
Let's go?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……終わったのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Is it over?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276580</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>みたい……
ちょっと空気が
違うっぽく感じる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Looks like it... Even
the air feels a little
different, somehow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276820</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>う～ん……とりあえず、
外出てみたら
なんかわかるかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmmm... For now, let's
go outside. We'll probably
be able to tell from there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Arche&gt;さん、
&lt;Red&gt;ユークリッド村&lt;White&gt;って
言ってたよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Arche&gt; said we
need to go to
&lt;Red&gt;Euclid&lt;White&gt;, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_030_070_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん。行ってみよーぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. Let's go
check it out.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
